# Enforce LF line endings for text assets so the dashboard's SRI integrity
# hashes (sha384 over the raw bytes) stay valid regardless of the checkout
# platform. A CRLF workspace would silently corrupt the hash and white-screen
# the dashboard. Apply to the vendored SPA + Lua sources.
*        text=auto eol=lf
*.lua    text eol=lf
*.js     text eol=lf
*.html   text eol=lf
*.css    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.conf   text eol=lf
*.go     text eol=lf
